# Every slide on the flat rail, backside: the slide table's rail crossed 25 degrees off square, drifting
# toward the toe side, so the rider slides facing the way it goes (the view's review: tricks.strips).
park lab
cmd 0 teleport -8.5 1.4 0.14 25
hold up 6..80
hold ollie 70..90
tap grind 128
tap grind+up 150
tap grind+down 172
tap grind 194
tap grind+down+left 216
tap grind+up+left 238
tap grind 260
bot balance
run 500
expect event grindStart{trick=BS Boardslide,slide=true} within 129..130
expect event grindStart{trick=BS Noseslide,slide=true} within 151..152
expect event grindStart{trick=BS Tailslide,slide=true} within 173..174
expect event grindStart{trick=BS Lipslide,slide=true} within 195..196
expect event grindStart{trick=BS Bluntslide,slide=true} within 217..218
expect event grindStart{trick=BS Nosebluntslide,slide=true} within 239..240
expect event grindStart{trick=BS Lipslide,slide=true} within 261..262
expect no event bail
